# Transcribed from Movy's browser-test/logic/automation.mjs at 9190e79
# (github.com/DimaDake/schwung-movy, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 megadake;
# engines/third_party/movy/LICENSE) to the FM-1's panel (docs/15 S8).
# Its "knob routing" under live record: playing and recording (an overdub,
# REC over notes), a knob turned at step 8 (index 7) gives Timbre a lane and
# writes a lock at the playing step that is heard: no quiet flag (`aset 0
# 0 7 N`); a second detent moves it on from there. No `abase` follows the
# take (Movy's "recorded-lane release issues no abase revert").
--button 0.05:PLAY/STOP
--button 0.10:REC
--turn 0.53:KNOB3:2
--turn 0.54:KNOB3:1
